ion></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">shop_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-1robXu3f\">要授权的店铺id</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">shop_auth_time_type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-2afRO1kl\"> 授权时间类型，默认不限，允许值</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-LA09ZWX7\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-QQQWO3GU\"><code>NONE</code> 不限</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-UAAlNnWf\"><code>CUSTOM</code> 自定义</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">end_time</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag success\">条件必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-IEKqLjD7\">授权结束时间，当shop_auth_time_type=CUSTOM时必填</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-VRzv0hzI\">格式为yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss</p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-PLdELkqh\" id=\"h346b9f0-PLdELkqh\">请求示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-mulit-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"multicodeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22langs%22%3A%5B%7B%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%23%20coding%3Dutf-8%5Cnimport%20js